40-## Postulate
--
52-The adopted object is a formal local Lagrangian density made from finitely many fields, covariant derivatives, and field strengths at one spacetime point, contracted to Lorentz scalars and invariant under the stated gauge and global actions. The renormalizable part has the gauge kinetic terms $-\tfrac14G^A_{\mu\nu}G^{A\mu\nu}-\tfrac14W^I_{\mu\nu}W^{I\mu\nu}-\tfrac14B_{\mu\nu}B^{\mu\nu}$, fermion kinetic terms $i\sum_\psi\bar\psi\gamma^\mu D_\mu\psi$, Higgs kinetic term $-(D_\mu H)^\dagger D^\mu H$, the real gauge-invariant Higgs potential
53-$$V_4(H)=V_0-\mu_H^2H^\dagger H+\lambda(H^\dagger H)^2,\qquad V_0,\mu_H^2,\lambda\in\mathbb R,$$
