+---
+id: exp-aqft-cms-global-smeft-fit-2026
+kind: experiment
+title: CMS global dimension-six SMEFT fit
+status: draft
+origin: pipeline
+pipeline_run: advanced-qft-supersymmetry-build-2026-10-23
